<title>UK: Deutsche Hypo Hannover sets 100 million mark bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hypo Hannover sets 100 million mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK HANNOVER</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.25	MATURITY    17.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  100.25    PAY DATE    17.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   LISTING    HANNOVER  DENOMS (K)  ONE</p>
<p> NOTES     *TO OCTOBER 1997 THEN 5.0 PCT THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>	    **CALLABLE AT PAR ON 17.OCT.97</p>
<p>		OFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 714</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
